---
title: "withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_canceled: check isCanceled == true
    q_check_canceled --> q_revert_state: sale not canceled
    q_revert_state --> [*]: revert SaleNotCanceled
    q_check_canceled --> q_check_refunded: sale is canceled
    q_check_refunded --> q_revert_dup: position.hasRefunded == true
    q_revert_dup --> [*]: revert AlreadyRefunded
    q_check_refunded --> q_get_amount: not yet refunded
    q_get_amount --> q_check_zero: amount = position.investedCapital
    q_check_zero --> q_revert_zero: amount == 0
    q_revert_zero --> [*]: revert NoInvestment
    q_check_zero --> q_update_state: amount > 0
    q_update_state --> q_transfer: position.hasRefunded = true
    q_transfer --> [*]: transfer(investor, amount), emit CancelRefunded

    note right of q_update_state
        INV-001: state updated before transfer (reentrancy protection)
        INV-002: full invested capital returned on cancellation
    end note
